{"real": true, "dur": 121.58, "sent": [{"start": 0.18, "end": 4.76, "text": "Take New Practical Chinese Reader, Book 1, Lesson 3.", "words": [{"w": "Take", "s": 0.18}, {"w": "New", "s": 0.5}, {"w": "Practical", "s": 0.8}, {"w": "Chinese", "s": 1.4}, {"w": "Reader,", "s": 1.82}, {"w": "Book", "s": 2.7}, {"w": "1,", "s": 3.16}, {"w": "Lesson", "s": 3.98}, {"w": "3.", "s": 4.74}]}, {"start": 5.68, "end": 12.82, "text": "The title is “What country is she from?” The book gives you a text, some notes and pronunciation practice.", "words": [{"w": "The", "s": 5.68}, {"w": "title", "s": 5.82}, {"w": "is", "s": 6.24}, {"w": "“What", "s": 6.4}, {"w": "country", "s": 6.86}, {"w": "is", "s": 7.46}, {"w": "she", "s": 7.62}, {"w": "from?”", "s": 7.82}, {"w": "The", "s": 8.86}, {"w": "book", "s": 8.98}, {"w": "gives", "s": 9.2}, {"w": "you", "s": 9.5}, {"w": "a", "s": 9.72}, {"w": "text,", "s": 9.84}, {"w": "some", "s": 10.54}, {"w": "notes", "s": 10.8}, {"w": "and", "s": 11.32}, {"w": "pronunciation", "s": 11.52}, {"w": "practice.", "s": 12.32}]}, {"start": 13.28, "end": 19.5, "text": "But there are no situations, no task, and this lesson doesn’t even have a grammar section.", "words": [{"w": "But", "s": 13.28}, {"w": "there", "s": 13.68}, {"w": "are", "s": 13.82}, {"w": "no", "s": 13.98}, {"w": "situations,", "s": 14.16}, {"w": "no", "s": 15.52}, {"w": "task,", "s": 15.76}, {"w": "and", "s": 16.6}, {"w": "this", "s": 16.84}, {"w": "lesson", "s": 17.12}, {"w": "doesn’t", "s": 17.74}, {"w": "even", "s": 18.16}, {"w": "have", "s": 18.44}, {"w": "a", "s": 18.6}, {"w": "grammar", "s": 18.7}, {"w": "section.", "s": 19.06}]}, {"start": 20.12, "end": 22.78, "text": "So I start from what the text actually does.", "words": [{"w": "So", "s": 20.12}, {"w": "I", "s": 20.5}, {"w": "start", "s": 20.66}, {"w": "from", "s": 20.94}, {"w": "what", "s": 21.2}, {"w": "the", "s": 21.38}, {"w": "text", "s": 21.56}, {"w": "actually", "s": 22.02}, {"w": "does.", "s": 22.42}]}, {"start": 23.46, "end": 24.56, "text": "Look at the first dialogue.", "words": [{"w": "Look", "s": 23.46}, {"w": "at", "s": 23.62}, {"w": "the", "s": 23.74}, {"w": "first", "s": 23.88}, {"w": "dialogue.", "s": 24.14}]}, {"start": 25.2, "end": 27.86, "text": "First, someone asks who that is.", "words": [{"w": "First,", "s": 25.2}, {"w": "someone", "s": 26.08}, {"w": "asks", "s": 26.6}, {"w": "who", "s": 27.14}, {"w": "that", "s": 27.36}, {"w": "is.", "s": 27.6}]}, {"start": 28.32, "end": 30.74, "text": "The answer: that’s our teacher.", "words": [{"w": "The", "s": 28.32}, {"w": "answer:", "s": 28.48}, {"w": "that’s", "s": 29.7}, {"w": "our", "s": 30.0}, {"w": "teacher.", "s": 30.28}]}, {"start": 31.6, "end": 34.1, "text": "Then: what country is she from?", "words": [{"w": "Then:", "s": 31.6}, {"w": "what", "s": 32.56}, {"w": "country", "s": 32.82}, {"w": "is", "s": 33.34}, {"w": "she", "s": 33.54}, {"w": "from?", "s": 33.82}]}, {"start": 34.8, "end": 35.84, "text": "She’s Chinese.", "words": [{"w": "She’s", "s": 34.8}, {"w": "Chinese.", "s": 35.12}]}, {"start": 36.64, "end": 40.1, "text": "And then: all our teachers are Chinese.", "words": [{"w": "And", "s": 36.64}, {"w": "then:", "s": 36.88}, {"w": "all", "s": 37.86}, {"w": "our", "s": 38.2}, {"w": "teachers", "s": 38.52}, {"w": "are", "s": 39.2}, {"w": "Chinese.", "s": 39.4}]}, {"start": 40.68, "end": 49.88, "text": "So from that short dialogue, I can identify two things learners need to do: identify someone and say where they’re from.", "words": [{"w": "So", "s": 40.68}, {"w": "from", "s": 40.94}, {"w": "that", "s": 41.22}, {"w": "short", "s": 41.52}, {"w": "dialogue,", "s": 41.8}, {"w": "I", "s": 42.88}, {"w": "can", "s": 43.0}, {"w": "identify", "s": 43.26}, {"w": "two", "s": 44.06}, {"w": "things", "s": 44.36}, {"w": "learners", "s": 44.72}, {"w": "need", "s": 45.18}, {"w": "to", "s": 45.42}, {"w": "do:", "s": 45.6}, {"w": "identify", "s": 46.56}, {"w": "someone", "s": 47.4}, {"w": "and", "s": 48.28}, {"w": "say", "s": 48.52}, {"w": "where", "s": 49.06}, {"w": "they’re", "s": 49.28}, {"w": "from.", "s": 49.54}]}, {"start": 50.46, "end": 52.58, "text": "Next, the linguistic goals.", "words": [{"w": "Next,", "s": 50.46}, {"w": "the", "s": 51.32}, {"w": "linguistic", "s": 51.46}, {"w": "goals.", "s": 52.14}]}, {"start": 53.06, "end": 57.58, "text": "First, the verb “to be,” and how to make it negative.", "words": [{"w": "First,", "s": 53.06}, {"w": "the", "s": 53.96}, {"w": "verb", "s": 54.14}, {"w": "“to", "s": 54.36}, {"w": "be,”", "s": 54.72}, {"w": "and", "s": 55.88}, {"w": "how", "s": 56.12}, {"w": "to", "s": 56.36}, {"w": "make", "s": 56.5}, {"w": "it", "s": 56.7}, {"w": "negative.", "s": 56.96}]}, {"start": 58.0, "end": 75.4, "text": "Then the question word “who.” Then the nationality pattern: country plus “person.” And the word “all.” Learners have already seen it in Lesson 2, but they won’t study where it goes in a sentence until Lesson 7.", "words": [{"w": "Then", "s": 58.0}, {"w": "the", "s": 58.26}, {"w": "question", "s": 58.42}, {"w": "word", "s": 58.84}, {"w": "“who.”", "s": 59.08}, {"w": "Then", "s": 60.44}, {"w": "the", "s": 60.64}, {"w": "nationality", "s": 60.82}, {"w": "pattern:", "s": 61.86}, {"w": "country", "s": 62.78}, {"w": "plus", "s": 63.58}, {"w": "“person.”", "s": 63.86}, {"w": "And", "s": 65.34}, {"w": "the", "s": 65.519}, {"w": "word", "s": 65.7}, {"w": "“all.”", "s": 65.92}, {"w": "Learners", "s": 67.46}, {"w": "have", "s": 67.92}, {"w": "already", "s": 68.2}, {"w": "seen", "s": 68.7}, {"w": "it", "s": 68.9}, {"w": "in", "s": 69.12}, {"w": "Lesson", "s": 69.24}, {"w": "2,", "s": 69.88}, {"w": "but", "s": 70.32}, {"w": "they", "s": 70.48}, {"w": "won’t", "s": 70.7}, {"w": "study", "s": 71.02}, {"w": "where", "s": 71.44}, {"w": "it", "s": 71.68}, {"w": "goes", "s": 71.84}, {"w": "in", "s": 72.22}, {"w": "a", "s": 72.36}, {"w": "sentence", "s": 72.48}, {"w": "until", "s": 73.42}, {"w": "Lesson", "s": 74.62}, {"w": "7.", "s": 75.38}]}, {"start": 76.16, "end": 81.38, "text": "So for now, they just encounter it, without practising it separately.", "words": [{"w": "So", "s": 76.16}, {"w": "for", "s": 76.34}, {"w": "now,", "s": 76.54}, {"w": "they", "s": 77.32}, {"w": "just", "s": 77.58}, {"w": "encounter", "s": 77.96}, {"w": "it,", "s": 78.6}, {"w": "without", "s": 79.4}, {"w": "practising", "s": 79.82}, {"w": "it", "s": 80.46}, {"w": "separately.", "s": 80.82}]}, {"start": 81.8, "end": 86.92, "text": "Finally, one sound: the negative word changes its tone before a fourth tone.", "words": [{"w": "Finally,", "s": 81.8}, {"w": "one", "s": 82.6}, {"w": "sound:", "s": 82.88}, {"w": "the", "s": 83.86}, {"w": "negative", "s": 84.02}, {"w": "word", "s": 84.48}, {"w": "changes", "s": 84.76}, {"w": "its", "s": 85.2}, {"w": "tone", "s": 85.42}, {"w": "before", "s": 85.78}, {"w": "a", "s": 86.14}, {"w": "fourth", "s": 86.3}, {"w": "tone.", "s": 86.62}]}, {"start": 88.04, "end": 92.54, "text": "So “is” and “is not” are said with different tones.", "words": [{"w": "So", "s": 88.04}, {"w": "“is”", "s": 88.2}, {"w": "and", "s": 89.32}, {"w": "“is", "s": 89.44}, {"w": "not”", "s": 89.96}, {"w": "are", "s": 90.88}, {"w": "said", "s": 91.1}, {"w": "with", "s": 91.38}, {"w": "different", "s": 91.66}, {"w": "tones.", "s": 92.12}]}, {"start": 93.4, "end": 94.72, "text": "Notice the change here.", "words": [{"w": "Notice", "s": 93.4}, {"w": "the", "s": 93.86}, {"w": "change", "s": 94.04}, {"w": "here.", "s": 94.48}]}, {"start": 95.54, "end": 98.92, "text": "As you can see, it’s the same grid as in French.", "words": [{"w": "As", "s": 95.54}, {"w": "you", "s": 95.76}, {"w": "can", "s": 95.88}, {"w": "see,", "s": 96.14}, {"w": "it’s", "s": 96.96}, {"w": "the", "s": 97.16}, {"w": "same", "s": 97.36}, {"w": "grid", "s": 97.66}, {"w": "as", "s": 98.2}, {"w": "in", "s": 98.4}, {"w": "French.", "s": 98.58}]}, {"start": 99.42, "end": 103.76, "text": "Only the content is new, and everything comes from the book.", "words": [{"w": "Only", "s": 99.42}, {"w": "the", "s": 99.72}, {"w": "content", "s": 99.86}, {"w": "is", "s": 100.58}, {"w": "new,", "s": 100.84}, {"w": "and", "s": 101.66}, {"w": "everything", "s": 101.96}, {"w": "comes", "s": 102.72}, {"w": "from", "s": 103.16}, {"w": "the", "s": 103.42}, {"w": "book.", "s": 103.56}]}, {"start": 104.62, "end": 112.58, "text": "In other words, I keep the same basic structure, but adapt the goals, exercises and situations to Chinese.", "words": [{"w": "In", "s": 104.62}, {"w": "other", "s": 104.78}, {"w": "words,", "s": 105.02}, {"w": "I", "s": 106.1}, {"w": "keep", "s": 106.18}, {"w": "the", "s": 106.44}, {"w": "same", "s": 106.62}, {"w": "basic", "s": 106.98}, {"w": "structure,", "s": 107.44}, {"w": "but", "s": 108.6}, {"w": "adapt", "s": 108.82}, {"w": "the", "s": 109.26}, {"w": "goals,", "s": 109.42}, {"w": "exercises", "s": 110.1}, {"w": "and", "s": 111.02}, {"w": "situations", "s": 111.22}, {"w": "to", "s": 111.94}, {"w": "Chinese.", "s": 112.1}]}, {"start": 113.1, "end": 116.96, "text": "And the textbook determines what learners are expected to know.", "words": [{"w": "And", "s": 113.1}, {"w": "the", "s": 113.22}, {"w": "textbook", "s": 113.38}, {"w": "determines", "s": 113.86}, {"w": "what", "s": 114.8}, {"w": "learners", "s": 115.04}, {"w": "are", "s": 115.72}, {"w": "expected", "s": 115.94}, {"w": "to", "s": 116.6}, {"w": "know.", "s": 116.74}]}, {"start": 117.9, "end": 120.9, "text": "That’s how the French template becomes a Chinese one.", "words": [{"w": "That’s", "s": 117.9}, {"w": "how", "s": 118.16}, {"w": "the", "s": 118.44}, {"w": "French", "s": 118.58}, {"w": "template", "s": 118.94}, {"w": "becomes", "s": 119.64}, {"w": "a", "s": 120.2}, {"w": "Chinese", "s": 120.3}, {"w": "one.", "s": 120.7}]}]}